# Agent loops

- One slice at a time (`docs/slices/`). Do not start S(n+1) until S(n) tests are green and `STATUS.md` is updated.
- **Fail:** update `STATUS.md`, stop. Do not start S(n+1).
- **Green:** update `STATUS.md`. Compact per [docs/compaction.md](docs/compaction.md) (STATUS + tests are memory; do not reopen this slice). Immediately continue S(n+1): `AGENTS.md` → `STATUS.md` → next slice card → cited sections only. Application code is authorized for that next slice. Do not wait for a new Build prompt. If this was S13, stop (v1 complete).
- Done-when is the slice test command plus `docs/fixtures/` expected.json — not a chat opinion.
- Near **100k tokens** *mid-slice*: update `STATUS.md`, compact, resume the **same** slice. Do not jump ahead if the current test is not green.
- Do not re-pick TypeScript/Vite/React/SVG/Vitest or Planck.js in chat (ADR-001, ADR-004).
- Commit only if Brian asks.
